  subtitles:
  - line: "Oh! \u2018Scuse me\u2026"
    seconds: 1.912
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Sorry, sorry, sorry.
    seconds: 8.476
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Uh, classical stuff. You listen to tapes, too, Lewis?
    seconds: 12.829
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Ha, no. I\u2019ve got a bone to pick with the record industry as a whole."
    seconds: 16.951
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "That\u2019s cool though. \u2018Classical in Cupboards\u2019."
    seconds: 20.803
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "Yep. Since the Pandora\u2019s storage closets were too crowded\u2026"
    seconds: 24.486
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: Seriously?
    seconds: 26.749
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
  - line: "You\u2019d be surprised how many people need storage closets."
    seconds: 29.443
    isFromRadio: 1
    isIntoRadio: 0
